      "Colleagues 8, 9, 10": "Defected / pushed back in favor of Plato! They are using the doxographical argument (recorded by Plutarch/Diogenes Laërtius where Plato thanked the gods for being born Greek)."
    }
  },
  "threat_analysis": {
    "critical_hazard": "Colleagues 8, 9, and 10 explicitly cite PLUTARCH as the source of Plato's quote ('recorded in Plutarch and Diogenes Laërtius'). If they or anyone else consults the actual Spanish text to verify whether Plato or Pericles is mentioned, they will immediately discover that Plutarch itself is the subject ('en el primer siglo de nuestra era, Plutarco se burló...').",
