      "Reinforce that 8 out of 11 respondents agree on Pericles, Milton, Fichte, and urge the remaining three (8, 9, 10) to unite on this cohesive political triad to reach full consensus.",
      "Ensure I do not mention the phrase 'la luna de Atenas' or anything hinting at 1st-century CE/Plutarch."
    ]
  }
}

